-profiler-cli marker info m-92 --session good
-```
-
-```
-Marker m-92: DispatchTransaction
-
-Type: Url
-Category: Network
-Time: 36.07ms - 323.87ms (287.80ms)
-Thread: t-0 (Parent Process)
-
