-  f-1301. xul.dll!jsimd_idct_islow_avx2 - self: 63 (26.5%)
-  f-1311. xul.dll!decode_mcu_fast(jpeg_decompress_struct*, short[64]**) - self: 19 (8.0%)
-  f-1312. xul.dll!jsimd_ycc_extbgrx_convert_avx2 - self: 12 (5.0%)
