-```
-By Name:
-  Jank   1 marker   (4.17s)
-    Examples: m-20 (4.17s at 1.29s - 5.46s)
-```
-
-The Jank marker confirms the hang started at 1.29s and lasted until the end of the profile, 4.17 seconds.
